{
  "name": "security-pack-v0",
  "description": "The taint model pack. Sources, sinks, passthroughs, sanitizers and effects are DATA: the engine matches callee symbols against these patterns (suffix-segment match, see PatternMatcher) and never hard-codes a rule. Argument-index convention: 0 is the RECEIVER when the callee has one, otherwise the first argument; n is the n-th element of that (receiver,) arguments sequence; -1 is the call's result. Constructor callees render as the class FQN (no <init> suffix). P4 is the first phase that executes this pack, which is why several P0 seed entries carry corrected indexes.",
